# ─── AI Documentation (Agent Files) ─────────
# AI-specific documentation files for development context
# These files reduce token usage when working with AI assistants
# Auto-generated and frequently updated - should not be committed

# Core context files
CLAUDE.md
BACKEND_CONTEXT.md
FRONTEND_CONTEXT.md
PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md

# Dataset documentation
DATASETS_ANALYSIS.md
data/DATASET_USAGE_GUIDE.md

# API & technical references
API_REFERENCE.md
TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md

# Old integration documentation (if any remain)
INTEGRATION_*.md
REBUILD_*.md
START_HERE.md
QUICK_START.md
PROJECT_DOCS.md
TEST_*.md
*_SUMMARY.txt
prompt.md

# Agent checkpoint/session files
.copilot/
.cursor/

